# Community apps

These apps run on servers, so they need an internet connection. Each is its own site on a `radii-office.com` address!


::divider{wavy|Community apps|orange}
## Phosphor

#G#Messaging#= [phosphor.radii-office.com](https://phosphor.radii-office.com)

A Discord-style chat. Make an account and you can:

* Create #TU.flag(servers) with #TU.flag(channels), #TU.flag(roles) and permissions!
* Send #TU.flag(direct messages) and make #TU.flag(group chats), and add #TU.flag(friends)!
* Use #TU.flag(custom emojis), reactions, pins, threads and polls!
* Join #TU.flag(voice channels) (up to 8 people)!
* Add #TU.flag(webhooks), and use slash commands like `/me`, `/shrug`, `/poll` and `/nick`!
* Jump anywhere with the #TU.flag(quick switcher) (Ctrl+K)!

Messages are written in Keydown!

## Antimony

#C#Boards#= [Open Antimony](/antimony)

A free message board. Make spaces, post and reply, and watch new messages appear as they arrive!

## Beta

#L#Microblog#= [beta.radii-office.com](https://beta.radii-office.com)

Short posts with `#topics`. You can follow people, like, reply, run polls, make lists, keep drafts and collections, set reminders and ask questions. #L.flag(Outlets) are rooms for group talk, and there is a #L.flag(Friends) feature. Each Beta instance picks its own usernames!

## Mintcode

#TU#Code hosting#= [mintcode.radii-office.com](https://mintcode.radii-office.com)

Host code with #B.flag(Mint), a simple saves-and-lines version tool. It has repositories, stars, forks, issues and a web editor!

## Overshare

#PR#Sharing#= [overshare.radii-office.com](https://overshare.radii-office.com)

Share documents and work on them together. Read more in [Sharing](#/sharing)!

## Keydown in the community apps

Phosphor, Beta, Mintcode and Antimony all draw Keydown in messages and posts. Their copy of Keydown is cleaned a second time after it is drawn, so scripts and frames can't get through!
